Description: Production-grade R artifacts for testing Valence-Ingression
    framework predictions. Provides PGLS comparative methods, integration-depth
    ordering tests, biphasic genome reduction models, cross-kingdom parameter
    transfer, formal dynamical model (threshold-gated capacity reallocation),
    and simulacrum test bed for parameter recovery. Implements the MPI Handoff
    Blueprint architecture with DFT axiom compliance, STDD for stochastic
    operations, and testcontainers simulacrum infrastructure. Phosphene R
    engineering standards are reproduced in docs/standards/ for self-sufficiency.
